WEBVTT

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:12.120
The universe is the second home of mankind.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:16.710
When the earth couldn't support the over-increased population,

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:22.670
people created new lands and cities in the universe.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.580
That is the space colony.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.450
In the first large colony,

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.320
Since the beginning of the life of 40 million people,

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.560
The space century has begun.

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.430
Space Colony

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:48.110
The giant chimney itself rotates.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.500
It generates gravity on the land of the population on the inner wall.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:59.260
The three giant mirrors show the inside of the colony.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:10.660
Light is used to create forests and lakes, and the weather is controlled freely there.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:20.700
Such huge constructions are the first to be able to be developed with reinforced space suits and working mobiles.

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:25.430
And this develops into a mobile suit.

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:34.650
Mobile Suit, the ultimate mobile weapon created by the space century.

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:41.800
In this era, when the radar became powerless due to the discovery of the Minovsky particle,

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:45.740
Mobile Suit, which can fight, became the strongest weapon.

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:52.040
And when they learned that its combat ability was comparable to that of the space junior ship,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.910
people were eager to fight.

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:07.600
Zaku, the first mass-produced mobile suit developed by Zaku in the W.O. 17th century,

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.040
was named the Zeon Empire by the Space Colony Nation, Side 3,

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.480
and declared independence from the Earth Federation,

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.480
and entered the first ever battle between the Earth and the universe.

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:23.200
Change sadness into anger, and stand up, citizens!

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:24.800
We, the citizens of the Zeon Empire,

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.840
must not forget that we are the chosen people.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.380
I hope you don't forget that you're a hero.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:31.960
I will save humanity!

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:38.690
J-J-O-N-I-Y

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:48.900
The colony has fallen.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.140
This operation, which showed the threat of Zaku,

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.240
took tens of millions of lives in an instant.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:22.480
Amuro Ray, a boy who accidentally got on the latest mobile suit Gundam of the Federal Army, grows into an invincible warrior in many battles.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:27.980
What the hell is this guy?

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.880
It's amazing! It has more than five times its energy!

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.110
I'll give it a try!

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:48.720
The Gundam's powerful combat power, feared to be a mobile suit.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:52.110
The Anbo-Rei was awakened as a new type.

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:58.640
The times called it the heart of man.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:11.320
However, people have not yet been convinced, and humanity has once again started a conflict.

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:25.940
With the help of elite soldiers, the Titans aim to control the Earth itself.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:29.040
With the help of Jamtov Hyman,

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:57.780
On the other hand, E.U.U.G.O., which was organized against the Titans, also participated in the former Zeon's red comet, Char Aznable.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.660
Time has already passed.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.720
The time has come to take humanity from Earth!

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:07.750
After that, why do humans have to fight and pollute the Earth?

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:11.080
People may not be able to wake up forever.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:13.890
I believe.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:18.500
Just like Amuro once told us, now there is a god dragon.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:28.820
In the era of the dragon, many people were swallowed up by a giant whirlpool,

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:29.800
I'm going to kill you.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:45.820
Agama went to Side 1 to heal his wounded heart and body after completing the mission of Gryps II Workshop.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:57.220
0301, we defeated Siroc and sunk the Jupiteris, but the cost was too great.

